  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Wu Shuai’s force breaks into Xia clan’s public blessed land, Xia Rui Zhi orders the clan into the Immortal Gu Houses. Xia clan has two Immortal Gu Houses, both rank seven. One is Whale Fishing Boat, the other is Golden Star Tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1982
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "char_xia_rui_zhi",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_whale_fishing_boat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Ying dodges an attack and enters Golden Star Tower. She does not escape. She steers Golden Star Tower to the front and tells everyone to leave, saying she will block them. Golden Star Tower charges relentlessly, using killer moves. Golden stars shoot out everywhere, and the variant humans quickly dodge them. The remaining Xia clan Gu Immortals enter Whale Fishing Boat and escape their headquarters.",
      "chapters": [
        1982
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Golden Star Tower is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Eastern Sea’s Xia clan, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In combat its killer moves shoot golden stars.",
      "chapters": [
        1982
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-stars",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Ying, inside Golden Star Tower, becomes anxious. It is tough to deal with the rank eights. She seems to have the upper hand but cannot last long. Wu Shuai notes that Eastern Sea’s Xia clan, even without a rank eight, can rely on rank seven Immortal Gu Houses to put up a fight, and he leaves the rank eights to deal with one rank seven immortal and a rank seven Immortal Gu House.",
      "chapters": [
        1983
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rear-guard-defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Ying is unable to escape in the end, though many of the rank eights are injured as well. The one who defeated Golden Star Tower is Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch.",
      "chapters": [
        1983
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
